## Story 9: Confirm the DFS batch-to-pain.001 field mapping and message content with FIS

**Story points:** 2

**User story**
As the Wire II developer, I want written confirmation from FIS on the points the specification leaves open, so that the mapping is confirmed and documented, not assumed.

**Description**
Questions for FIS: the DFS batch-to-pain.001 field mapping (customer info to ultimate debtor, DFS info to debtor); what OPF expects inside the supplementary data envelope; whether UETR and the Business Application Header are mandatory; whether pain.001.001.11 is the only accepted version.

**Acceptance criteria**
- Answers recorded on the Wire II design page with date and FIS contact.
- Story 1 mapping note updated.

